  "fullDescription": "Bundle of stickers for Halloween. Made in kawaii style. Cartoon characters, sweets, funny owls and cakes will not leave you indifferent)). The set consists of 57 images of holiday attributes with and without outline for your convenience. Images have no watermarks. Images are suitable for stickers and sublimation.\n\nPerfect for planner stickers, greeting cards, banners, invitations, magnets, flyers, badges, t-shirt prints, notepads.\n\nYou receive a zip file that includes:\n\n1.57 PNG cliparts without white outline in size 4000×4000 pixels, with a resolution of 300 ppi on a transparent background for sublimation;\n2.57 EPS10 cliparts without white outline in size 1000×1000 pixels;\n3.57 PNG cliparts with white outline (stickers), size 4000×4000 pixels, with a resolution of 300 ppi on a transparent background;\n4.57 EPS10 cliparts with white outline (stickers) in size 1000×1000 pixels.\n\nYou also get a 1 EPS10 file and 1PNG file with all the stickers. Plus a bonus of 5 skull stickers.\n\nAlso, stickers were prepared in convenient for printing 5 formats PNG 1801×2401 pixels (25.01x 33.35 inches) on transparent backgrounds with a white outline.\n\nThese files are for digital download only – no physical products will be sent to you.\n\nPLEASE NOTE:\nColors may differ from actual load depending on computer monitor and resolution. Consequently, there may be some discrepancy between how colors are displayed on the screen and the actual print.\n\nIf you have any questions, please contact me.\nThank you for visiting my store! Have a nice day!)",
